( MUFFLED GASPING )

43
00:03:48,479 --> 00:03:49,480
( GASPING STOPS )

44
00:03:54,944 --> 00:03:56,237
Off to bed , Alicia .

45
00:03:56,654 --> 00:03:58,322
Your father and I are just talking .

46
00:04:00,324 --> 00:04:01,492
Go on .

47
00:04:05,579 --> 00:04:06,831
♪ ♪

