223
00:20:35,985 --> 00:20:37,153
Interesting .

224
00:20:39,948 --> 00:20:41,825
Someone told you something , didn 't they ?

225
00:20:45,662 --> 00:20:49,124
Ah , well , you will be begging to tell me soon enough .

226
00:20:51,668 --> 00:20:53,169
